          "field": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Field represent different offer criteria properties. <br><br>'field': 'cusip'<br>'description': CUSIP with or without the 9th check digit<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported. It can be a comma separated list.<br><br>'field': 'privatePlacement'<br>'description': Indicator whether deal is a private placement<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Values are \u201cY\u201d or \u201cN\u201d<br><br>'field': 'resetMode'<br>'description': Rate reset mode - please see Code Table API to retrieve permissible values<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported.<br><br>'field': 'productType'<br>'description': Type of TEMMS product - please see Code Table API to retrieve permissible values<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported. For example VRDO or tender option bond.<br><br>'field': 'federalTaxProvision'<br>'description': Federal tax status of the issue - please see Code Table API to retrieve permissible values<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported.<br><br>'field': 'creditProvider'<br>'description': Description of the issue\u2019s credit provider<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported.<br><br>'field': 'excludeCreditProvider'<br>'description': Flag to exclude a specific credit provider<br>'type': 'boolean'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported.<br><br>'field': 'liquidityProvider'<br>'description': Description of the issue\u2019s liquidity provided<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported.<br><br>'field': 'excludeLiquidityProvider'<br>'description': Flag to exclude a specific liquidity provider<br>'type': 'boolean'<br>'additional': Only the \u201c=\u201d operand supported.<br><br>'field': 'states'<br>'description': State of issuance of the bond. See <a href='https://pe.usps.com/text/pub28/28apb.htm' target='_blank'>USPS</a> for state abbreviations honored<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c=\u201d supported. It can be a comma separated list<br><br>'field': 'rate'<br>'description': Interest rate applied to the issue<br>'type': 'number'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c>=\u201d is supported.<br><br>'field': 'rate'<br>'description': Interest rate applied to the issue<br>'type': 'number'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c<=\u201d is supported.<br><br>'field': 'offerSizeDollarAmount'<br>'description': Size of the offer available<br>'type': 'integer'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c>=\u201d is supported.<br><br>'field': 'offerSizeDollarAmount'<br>'description': Size of the offer available<br>'type': 'integer'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c<=\u201d is supported.<br><br>'field': 'spShortRating'<br>'description': Moody Long term rating of the bond. See <a href='https://www.moodys.com/sites/products/productattachments/ap075378_1_1408_ki.pdf' target='_blank'>Moodys</a> for allowed enumerations of rating. Section \u201cMoody\u2019s Long-Term Rating Definitions\u201d. <br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c>=\u201d is supported.<br><br>'field': 'spShortRating'<br>'description': (Details above)<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c<=\u201d supported<br><br>'field': 'fitchShortRating'<br>'description': Fitch rating of the bond. See <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fitch_Ratings' target='_blank'>Wikipedia Fitch</a> for allowed enumeration of ratings. See section \u201cInvestment Scale\u201d. See code table for allowable values<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c>=\u201d is supported.<br><br>'field': 'fitchShortRating'<br>'description': (Details above)<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c<=\u201d supported<br><br>'field': 'moodysShortRating'<br>'description': Moody Long term rating of the bond. See <a href='https://www.moodys.com/sites/products/productattachments/ap075378_1_1408_ki.pdf' target='_bank' >Moodys</a> for allowed enumerations of rating. Section \u201cMoody\u2019s Long-Term Rating Definitions\u201d. See code table for allowable values<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operands \u201c>=\u201d supported<br><br>'field': 'moodysShortRating'<br>'description': (Details above)<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c<=\u201d supported<br><br>'field': 'settlementDate'<br>'description': Settlement date expected. Should match settlement dates offered by BofA Securities. Expected format YYYY-MM-DD. All numbers.<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operands \u201c>=\u201d supported.<br><br>'field': 'settlementDate'<br>'description': (Details above)<br>'type': 'string'<br>'additional': Only operand \u201c<=\u201d supported<br><br>Note that all fields may be empty in the request, and this will return all offers available to the user with no filters"
          },
